  "north_star": "From one qualified, rights-cleared representation of one previously unseen fixed-arm workcell, imported from an existing scene or capture when possible and newly captured only for measured gaps, prospectively decide which of two frozen policy or configuration candidates deserves the next scarce physical-test budget, or explicitly abstain, then verify that decision and at least one predicted failure boundary with randomized held-out physical trials.",
